From d44233f392666bc844def5de5503ad3f130857fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:24:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 101/107] test: resolve the image suite's engine at import and
 split test_514

The recipe, engine and model names were set to tflite at import and rebound
only under __main__, so a runner importing the module tested tflite whatever
it was asked for. They are now resolved from the arguments at import.

test_514 asserted 200 on the fake and 400 on a real engine under one name.
test_514 now runs on the fake only (the upload is not a decodable JPEG), and
test_514b checks that a real engine, not lemond's cap, refuses it, by status
and error type rather than the engine's wording.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
---
 test/server_image_classify.py | 52 +++++++++++++++++------------------
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

diff --git a/test/server_image_classify.py b/test/server_image_classify.py
index 6ca2db4a4..5babe7a17 100644
--- a/test/server_image_classify.py
+++ b/test/server_image_classify.py
